    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A quiet, soft-spoken Vistana in his late thirties with a distant, almost absent-minded countenance and a near-painful sincerity. He carries five daggers and wears studded leather armor.</p><p><strong>Beacon of Protection:</strong> While Argynvost's beacon shines, Arturi opposes Strahd, and he remains in Barovia, he gains +1 AC and saving throws. Apply this bonus manually.</p>",
